  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">She Leads Ethiopia 2021: Enhancing GYW participation in national-level decision making spaces.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall intended outcome of the She Leads is to ensure GYW perspectives are included in gender-responsive laws and policies, and societal norms and practices. To achieve this the program has designed two outcomes that are designed towards the three domains of changes (socio-cultural, CSO and Institutional). This specific project under the She Leads program will be implemented at national level and mainly focusing on the CSO and Institutional/government domain.</narrative>
  </description>
